sequenceDiagram
  participant Analyst
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Transaction Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Analyst->>UI: abre fila REVIEW
  UI->>API: GET transações REVIEW
  UI->>API: GET detalhes + histórico
  Analyst->>UI: escolhe APPROVE/BLOCK + motivo
  UI->>API: POST /analyst/transactions/{id}/reviews
  API->>DB: FraudReview + AuditEvent
  API->>DB: status final + status history
  API-->>UI: decisão registrada + correlation ID
